                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi s
                    %mo =
                    %mn 4
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} s = 4
              \.
          %p In this case the above Freund-Rubin solution is
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msub
                    %mi AdS
                    %mn 4
